              "type": "text",
              "text": "Explain why ",
              "marks": []
            },
            {
              "type": "math",
              "latex": "3^{n}+3^{n+1}=3^{n}(1+3)=4\\times3^{n}",
              "display": false
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": ". Then simplify the expressions below.",
              "marks": []
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [
      {
        "id": "p8-q17-root-bank-bd-q-92c2e61c-c70f-445b-ab63-7ce1066cbee9-p8-q17-explanation",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "Since $3^{n+1}=3^n\\times3$, both terms have the common factor $3^n$; $1+3=4$.",
          "worked": "By the product index law, $3^{n+1}=3^n\\times3$. Taking out the common factor $3^n$ gives $3^n(1+3)$, and evaluating the bracket gives $4\\times3^n$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 20,
        "responseSpace": "scaffold"
      },
      {
        "id": "p8-q17-root-bank-bd-q-92c2e61c-c70f-445b-ab63-7ce1066cbee9-p8-q17-parts",
        "type": "group",
        "label": "",
        "prompt": "",
        "layout": "grid",
        "columns": 2,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [
          {
            "id": "p8-q17-root-bank-bd-q-92c2e61c-c70f-445b-ab63-7ce1066cbee9-p8-q17-a",
            "type": "part",
            "label": "b",
            "prompt": "$7^{n+2}+7^n$",
            "layout": "list",
            "columns": null,
            "questionDiagrams": [],
            "children": [],
            "answer": {
              "short": "$50\\times7^n$",
              "worked": "$\\begin{align*}7^{n+2}+7^n&=7^n(7^2+1)\\\\7^{n+2}+7^n&=50\\times7^n\\end{align*}$",
              "solutionDiagrams": []
            },
            "answerSpaceMm": 24
          },
          {
            "id": "p8-q17-root-bank-bd-q-92c2e61c-c70f-445b-ab63-7ce1066cbee9-p8-q17-b",
            "type": "part",
            "label": "c",
            "prompt": "$\\dfrac{3^{n+3}-3^n}{3^n}$",
            "layout": "list",
            "columns": null,
            "questionDiagrams": [],
            "children": [],
            "answer": {
              "short": "$26$",
              "worked": "$\\begin{align*}\\frac{3^{n+3}-3^n}{3^n}&=\\frac{3^n(3^3-1)}{3^n}\\\\\\frac{3^{n+3}-3^n}{3^n}&=27-1\\\\\\frac{3^{n+3}-3^n}{3^n}&=26\\end{align*}$",
              "solutionDiagrams": []
            },
            "answerSpaceMm": 32
          },
          {
            "id": "p8-q17-root-bank-bd-q-92c2e61c-c70f-445b-ab63-7ce1066cbee9-p8-q17-c",
            "type": "part",
            "label": "d",
            "prompt": "$5^n-5^{n-3}$",
            "layout": "list",
            "columns": null,
            "questionDiagrams": [],
            "children": [],
            "answer": {
              "short": "$124\\times5^{n-3}$",
              "worked": "$\\begin{align*}5^n-5^{n-3}&=5^{n-3}(5^3-1)\\\\5^n-5^{n-3}&=124\\times5^{n-3}\\end{align*}$",
              "solutionDiagrams": []
            },
            "answerSpaceMm": 24
          },
          {
            "id": "p8-q17-root-bank-bd-q-92c2e61c-c70f-445b-ab63-7ce1066cbee9-p8-q17-d",
            "type": "part",
            "label": "e",
            "prompt": "$\\dfrac{7^n+7^{n+2}}{7^{n-1}+7^{n+1}}$",
            "layout": "list",
            "columns": null,
            "questionDiagrams": [],
            "children": [],
            "answer": {
              "short": "$7$",
              "worked": "$\\begin{align*}\\frac{7^n+7^{n+2}}{7^{n-1}+7^{n+1}}&=\\frac{7^n(1+7^2)}{7^{n-1}(1+7^2)}\\\\\\frac{7^n+7^{n+2}}{7^{n-1}+7^{n+1}}&=7^{n-(n-1)}\\\\\\frac{7^n+7^{n+2}}{7^{n-1}+7^{n+1}}&=7\\end{align*}$",
              "solutionDiagrams": []
            },
            "answerSpaceMm": 42
          },
          {
            "id": "p8-q17-root-bank-bd-q-92c2e61c-c70f-445b-ab63-7ce1066cbee9-p8-q17-e",
            "type": "part",
            "label": "f",
            "prompt": "$2^{2n+2}-2^{2n-1}$",
            "layout": "list",
            "columns": null,
            "questionDiagrams": [],
            "children": [],
            "answer": {
              "short": "$7\\times2^{2n-1}$",
              "worked": "$\\begin{align*}2^{2n+2}-2^{2n-1}&=2^{2n-1}(2^3-1)\\\\2^{2n+2}-2^{2n-1}&=7\\times2^{2n-1}\\end{align*}$",
              "solutionDiagrams": []
            },
            "answerSpaceMm": 24
          },
          {
            "id": "p8-q17-root-bank-bd-q-92c2e61c-c70f-445b-ab63-7ce1066cbee9-p8-q17-f",
            "type": "part",
            "label": "g",
            "prompt": "$\\dfrac{2^{2n}-2^{n-1}}{2^n-2^{-1}}$",
            "layout": "list",
            "columns": null,
            "questionDiagrams": [],
            "children": [],
            "answer": {
              "short": "$2^n$\n\nFactor out $2^n$ from the numerator, then cancel the common bracket.",
              "worked": "$\\begin{align*}\\frac{2^{2n}-2^{n-1}}{2^n-2^{-1}}&=\\frac{2^n(2^n-2^{-1})}{2^n-2^{-1}}\\\\\\frac{2^{2n}-2^{n-1}}{2^n-2^{-1}}&=2^n\\end{align*}$",
              "solutionDiagrams": []
            },
            "answerSpaceMm": 42
          }
        ]
      }
